WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.860
Lesson 4: Driving the case

2
00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:14.448
In candidate-led cases you are expected to steer, and even in interviewer-led ones, proposing next steps earns credit. Summarise as you go, and keep linking back to the goal.

3
00:00:14.698 --> 00:00:16.171
Three things to remember.

4
00:00:16.191 --> 00:00:19.643
End every answer with your next step and the data you need.

5
00:00:19.843 --> 00:00:21.800
Summarise when you finish a branch.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.960
Link findings back to the goal; step back out loud when lost.

7
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.900
The full lesson has a worked example, an exercise, and a quick quiz.
